  "job_B3.2.14_20251003_114613": {
    "text": "DOMINICA TERTIA IN QUADRAGESIMA.\nGehera\u00fe nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hw\u00e6t se \u00e6\u00feela lareow s\u00e6gde be manna teo\u00feungceape; he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nu\n& syn we gemyndige \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee us Crist sylfa bebead on \u00feyssum godspelle; he cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t we symle emb\nHw\u00e6t ure Drihten hine gemedemode, \u00fe\u00e6t he us sealde ealle \u00fea w\u00e6stmas \u00fee eor\u00fee for\u00febringe\u00fe; \u00feeah he\nNe b\u00e6d he no \u00fe\u00e6s for\u00feon \u00fee him \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6nig \u00feearf w\u00e6re, ac for\u00feon he wolde \u00e6g\u00fe\u00e6r ge ofer heofenum,\nUs is \u00feonne mycel ned\u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we gebugon to him, & \u00fe\u00e6t we motan brucan his wuldres f\u00e6gernesse.\nSwa Drihten sylfa w\u00e6s sprecende \u00feurh witgan, he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Bringa\u00fe ge on min beren eowerne teo\u00f0an\nHwylc beren m\u00e6nde he \u00feonne elles buton heofona rice?\n& he swa cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gedo\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t eow sy mete gearo on minum huse.\nHw\u00e6t m\u00e6nde he \u00feonne elles, buton \u00fe\u00e6t we gefyllon \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feearfan wambe mid urum godum?\n\u00deonne ne hingre\u00fe us n\u00e6fre on ecnesse, ac he us ontyne\u00fe heofenes \u00feeotan, & he us syle\u00fe his w\u00e6stma\n& be \u00feissum \u00feingum eallum ge\u00feenc, \u00feu dysega mon, hw\u00e6t yfela bebead Drihten \u00e6fre, \u00fe\u00e6t his lar n\u00e6re\n\u00deonne s\u00e6g\u00fe on \u00feissum bocum \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten sylf cw\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis mennissce cyn ne sceolde agimeleasian\n& gif we \u00fe\u00e6t nu ne do\u00fe, \u00feonne wyrce we us myccle synne on \u00feon.\n& us is get wyrse \u00fe\u00e6t we urne ceap teo\u00feian, gif we willa\u00fe syllan ure \u00fe\u00e6t wyrste Gode.\nCw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00e6\u00feela lareow, Weor\u00feia\u00fe ge eowerne Drihten God mid gedafenlicum \u00feingum, & onsecgg\u00e6\u00fe\nNe \u00feurfon ge wenan \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00fe\u00e6t orceape sellon \u00fe\u00e6t ge under Drihtnes borh sylla\u00fe, \u00feeh ge sona inst\u00e6pes\nHit is \u00feeh wen \u00fe\u00e6t feala manna \u00feence hwylcum edleane he onfo \u00e6t Drihtne, o\u00fe\u00fee hu God him \u00fe\u00e6t eft\nGif ge \u00feonne gelyfa\u00fe, cw\u00e6\u00fe Drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t eow \u00fe\u00e6t to gode gelimpe \u00fe\u00e6t ge her on minum naman sylla\u00fe,\nGif ge \u00feonne tweoga\u00fe be \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6lmessum \u00fee ge for Godes noman sylla\u00fe, & ge eow ondr\u00e6da\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ge\nOn \u00feissum godspelle s\u00e6g\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t ure teo\u00fean sceattas syn earmra manna gafol.\nAgifa\u00fe nu teo\u00fean d\u00e6l ealles \u00fe\u00e6s ceapes \u00fee ge habban earmum mannum, & to Godes cyrican, \u00fe\u00e6m\nGeseo\u00fe nu hu bli\u00fee \u00fea earman beo\u00fe, \u00feonne hi mon mid mete & mid hr\u00e6gle rete\u00fe; myccle bli\u00fere bi\u00f0 seo\nSe \u00fee buton \u00e6lmessan & f\u00e6stenne leofa\u00f0 se bi\u00f0 on helle cwelmed, & he n\u00e6fre r\u00e6ste nafa\u00fe.\nSwa Sanctus Paulus cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6tte God hete ealle \u00fea asw\u00e6man \u00e6t heofona rices dura, \u00fea \u00fee heora cyrican\nFor\u00feon ne \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6s nanne man tweogean, \u00fe\u00e6t seo forl\u00e6tene cyrice ne hycgge ymb \u00fea \u00fee on hire\nFor\u00feon, bro\u00feor mine \u00fea leofestan, sylla\u00fe ge eowere teo\u00fean sceattas \u00feyder; & \u00fe\u00e6r Gode d\u00e6la\u00fe \u00feam \u00fee\nSwa se \u00e6\u00feela lareow bebead \u00fe\u00e6t man Godes \u00e6we mid rihte heolde, & Godes cyricean f\u00e6ste tremede,\n\u00dea m\u00e6ssepreostas \u00fee Godes cyricena lareowas beo\u00fe, \u00fea sceolan heora scriftbec mid rihte t\u00e6can &\nNe wandige na se m\u00e6ssepreost no for rices mannes ege, ne for feo, ne for nanes mannes lufon, \u00fe\u00e6t he\nNe sceal he eac beon to georn deadra manna feos, ne to lyt \u00feancian heora \u00e6lmessan, for\u00feon \u00fee hie\n& \u00fea lareowas sceolan synnfullum mannum eadmodlice t\u00e6can & l\u00e6ran, \u00fe\u00e6t hie heora synna cunnon\nEala, cw\u00e6\u00fe Sanctus Paulus, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00fe deofles goldhord, \u00fe\u00e6t mon his synna dyrne his scrifte; for\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6m\nSe m\u00e6ssepreost se \u00fee bi\u00f0 to l\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t deofol of men adrife, & \u00fea sauwle ra\u00feost mid ele & mid\n\u00deonne s\u00e6gde Sanctus Pauwlus \u00fe\u00e6t he gesawe naht feor from \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ssepreostes sidan, \u00fee we \u00e6r bufan\n& \u00feone l\u00e6ddon feower awyrgde englas mid mycelre re\u00fenesse, & hine besencton on \u00fea fyrenan ea \u00e6t his\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00e6\u00feela lareow to \u00fe\u00e6m engle \u00fee hine l\u00e6dde, Hw\u00e6t is \u00fees ealda man?\nSe engel him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hit is an biscop se dyde mare yfel \u00feonne god; he onfeng for worlde mycelne\n\u00deonne s\u00e6gde Sanctus Paulus \u00fe\u00e6t se biscop n\u00e6re miltsiende wydewum, ne steopcildum, ne nanum\n& her s\u00e6g\u00fe on \u00feyssum bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m biscopum \u00fee her on worlde syndon, swy\u00fee gelice gegange\nSe biscop sceal, \u00fee wile onfon Godes mildheortnesse & his synna forgifnesse, \u00ferafian \u00fea\n& \u00fea l\u00e6wedan men \u00fee hie aldormen ofer beon sceolan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6m ne ge\u00feafian \u00fe\u00e6t hie heora lif on\nFor\u00feon se goda lareow s\u00e6gde, \u00feonne se m\u00e6ssepreost o\u00fe\u00fee se biscop w\u00e6re gel\u00e6ded on ece forwyrd;\nHwane mana\u00fe God maran gafoles \u00feonne \u00feone biscop?\nFor\u00feon \u00fee se biscop bi\u00fe Godes gingra, & he bi\u00fe efenhalig his apostolum, & efnhlete his witgum, gif\nSwa Sanctus Paulus s\u00e6gde, \u00fe\u00e6t Crist sylfa bebude Moyse \u00fe\u00e6t he o\u00ferum lareowum s\u00e6gde, gif hi \u00fe\u00e6t\nSwa se \u00e6\u00feela lareow s\u00e6gde, \u00fe\u00e6t se cyning & se biscop sceoldan beon Cristenra folca hyrdas, & hi\n& gif mon \u00feonne ne mihte hi to rihte gecyrron, \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora wohd\u00e6da geswican woldan, \u00feonne sceal\nSe biscop & se m\u00e6ssepreost gif hi mid rihte willa\u00fe Gode \u00feeowian, \u00feonne sceolan hi \u00feegnian\n\u00deonne onfo\u00fe hi from Gode maran mede \u00feonne hi from \u00e6nigum o\u00ferum lacum don; for\u00feon \u00fee Gode is\n& hi n\u00e6fre on heora synnum ne swylta\u00fe; & Godes mildheortnes bi\u00fe ofer hi, & ealra haligra.\n& God hafa\u00fe alyfed eor\u00felicum mannum \u00fe\u00e6t hi motan bletsian eal Cristen folc, & him gelome\n& \u00feis weorc bi\u00fe deoflum se m\u00e6sta teona; for\u00feon \u00fee hi habba\u00fe manega saule on heora gewaldum \u00fee\nCw\u00e6\u00fe se halga lareow, Ne ablinnan we, manna bearn, \u00fe\u00e6t we Gode cwemon, & deofol tynan, d\u00e6ges\n& eallum Cristenum mannum is beboden \u00fe\u00e6t hi ealne heora lichoman seofon si\u00feum gebletsian mid\n& gif \u00fea lareowas \u00feis nella\u00fe f\u00e6stlice Godes folce bebeodan, \u00feonne beo\u00fe hi wi\u00fe God swy\u00fee scyldige;\n& \u00fea lareowas beo\u00fe sy\u00fe\u00fean domes wyr\u00fee, gif hi nella\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t folc l\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6t hi heora synna geswicon, &\nSe biscop sceal beodan mid \u00feon m\u00e6ston bebode \u00fe\u00e6m m\u00e6ssepreostum, gif hi hi sylfe willon wi\u00fe\nNe sceolan \u00fea lareowas agimeleasian \u00fea lare, ne \u00fe\u00e6t folc ne sceal forhycggan \u00fe\u00e6t hi to him hi\nFor\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6r mon \u00fe\u00e6t godspel s\u00e6g\u00fe, maniges mannes heorte bi\u00fe onbryrded, & God bi\u00fe milde \u00fe\u00e6m\n\u00deonne sceolan \u00fea biscopas & \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas gehwylces hades men georne \u00fereatigean, & him\nGif him mon \u00feonne hyran nelle, \u00feonne mot se m\u00e6ssepreost hit wrecan, swa hit her beboden is, gif se\n& \u00feis sceal se m\u00e6ssepreost nede bebeodan, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s Godes \u00feeowes synna onfon, & he bi\u00fe \u00feonne\n\u00deonne s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6\u00feela lareow be \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan, \u00fe\u00e6t hi o\u00fere men be \u00feon l\u00e6ron mihton, & se bisceop &\nMoyses onfeng scinendum wuldorhelme, for\u00feon he symle \u00fea nyrugde \u00fee God oferhogodan.\nSe \u00fee Godes bebod oferhoga\u00fe, he bi\u00fe on h\u00e6\u00feenra onlicnesse, & manig deofol on him earda\u00fe.\nCw\u00e6\u00fe Sanctus Paulus, Mycel bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6s apostolican hades bebod; for\u00feon \u00fee Drihten cw\u00e6\u00fe to him \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00deonne l\u00e6re ic eow, bro\u00feor mine, \u00fe\u00e6t ge syllon eowre teo\u00fean sceattas earmum mannum \u00fee her for\n& swa hwylc man swa nele his ceapes & his w\u00e6stma \u00feone teo\u00fean d\u00e6l for Godes naman d\u00e6lan, \u00feonne\nAh he bi\u00f0 mid witum \u00feread \u00e6fter his dea\u00fee, & ealra his \u00e6hta \u00feonne idelhende, & him \u00feonne beo\u00fe\n& \u00e6ghwylcum men is beboden \u00fee on \u00e6nigum \u00feingum cr\u00e6ftig sy, o\u00fe\u00fee on maran wisdome o\u00fe\u00fee on\n& gif we \u00feonne lustlice & rumlice \u00fea welan d\u00e6la\u00fe earmum monnum, \u00fee us God \u00e6r sealde, \u00feonne onfo\nEala, cw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00e6\u00feela lareow, \u00feu dysega man, & \u00feu unsnottra, to hwon bescyredest \u00feu \u00fee twyfealdre\nFor hwon ne ge\u00feohtest \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t hit is eal Godes?\nEala \u00feu gitsigenda, & \u00feu welega, hw\u00e6t dest \u00feu \u00fee, gif Drihten on \u00fee genim\u00fe \u00fea nigan d\u00e6las, & \u00fee\nFor\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00fe buton synne \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fea nigan d\u00e6las on \u00feam men genime, \u00feonne he \u00fe\u00e6s teo\u00fean d\u00e6les\nHit is awriten on Cristes bocum \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten sylf cw\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea teo\u00fean sceattas w\u00e6ron on urum\nGif we \u00feonne bli\u00fee & rummodlice hi d\u00e6lan willa\u00fe earmum mannum, \u00feonne ontyne\u00fe us Drihten\nHw\u00e6t \u00e6ghwylc mon wile \u00fe\u00e6t him Drihten selle ealle his \u00feearfe, & hine ne lyst his willan wyrcean \u00fe\u00e6t\nFor hwon ne magon we ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t seo eor\u00fee is Godes?\n& Godes is \u00fe\u00e6t yrfe \u00fee we big leofia\u00fe; & we ealle syndon his.\n& on his onwealde is eal \u00fees middangeard, & \u00feas windas & \u00f0as regnas syndon ealle his \u00fea \u00fee eor\u00fean\n& ure Drihten is swi\u00fee gemyndig ealra \u00feara gifena \u00fee he us tol\u00e6te\u00fe; and we \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m ytmestan d\u00e6ge\nMen \u00fea leofestan, for hwon ne magon we ge\u00feencan, gif we ane hwile beo\u00fe on hwylcum earfo\u00feum \u00fe\u00e6r\nFor hwon ne magon we ge\u00feencan hwylc \u00fe\u00e6t wite bi\u00f0, \u00fee n\u00e6fre n\u00e6nig ende ne becyme\u00fe?\n\u00deonne manige ic nu mid godcundre stefne, cw\u00e6\u00fe se \u00e6\u00feela lareow, \u00fe\u00e6t ge eow alesan of eowrum\n& us is swi\u00fee uncu\u00fe hw\u00e6t ure yrfeweardas & lastweardas getreowlices don willon \u00e6fter urum life, gif\nFor\u00feon oft hit ges\u00e6le\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t his \u00e6hta weor\u00fea\u00fe on \u00fe\u00e6s onwealde \u00fee he \u00e6r on his life wyrrest u\u00fee,\n\u00deonne \u00fe\u00e6s monnes saul ut of his lichoman gange\u00fe, \u00fee him w\u00e6ron \u00e6r his \u00e6hta leofran to h\u00e6bbenne\n\u00deonne weor\u00fea\u00fe him ealle \u00fea eor\u00felican gefean, & \u00fea mycclan spr\u00e6ca & ofordruncennessa, \u00fea hleahtras\nBro\u00feor mine, cw\u00e6\u00fe Sanctus Paulus, ongyta\u00fe nu \u00feysne cwide, loca hw\u00e6t \u00fee sy her on worlde swetast\nGif \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ne wilt don, \u00e6fter \u00feinum dea\u00fee hit weor\u00fee\u00fe \u00fee swi\u00fee bitere forgolden; for\u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00fe\nManna freondscipe bi\u00fe swi\u00fee hwilwendlic, & swi\u00fee scendende; for\u00feon ure yldran swultan & swi\u00fee oft\nSo\u00fe is \u00fe\u00e6t is eow secgge, swa hwylc man swa nele Drihten lufian, & his \u00e6hta for his naman d\u00e6lan,\n& swa feala earmra manna swa on \u00fe\u00e6s rican neaweste & \u00fe\u00e6s welegan swelta\u00fe, & he him nele syllan\nFor\u00feon \u00fee he heold \u00e6r his \u00e6hta him to wean & to wlencum, & forwyrndon \u00feam Drihtnes \u00feearfum.\nSe mon se \u00fee wile \u00feone heofonlican gefean begytan, agife he symle mid rihte \u00feone teo\u00fean sceat Gode,\n& swa hw\u00e6t swa us God sylle mare \u00feonne we nede brucan sceolan, d\u00e6lon we \u00fe\u00e6t symle \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee\nAh we hit sceolan syllan to Godes cyrican, & \u00fe\u00e6m earmestum mannum d\u00e6lon, \u00feonne is \u00fe\u00e6t god, ge\n\u00dea welan, & \u00fe\u00e6t mycele gylp, & seo unrihtgitsung, & \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00fe\u00e6m earman forwyrne, \u00fe\u00e6t is eal\nWi\u00fesaca\u00fe nu \u00feam leasum welum, & \u00feam unalyfdum gestreonum, swa \u00fea halgan dydon \u00fee on \u00feyssum\nNis eow \u00feonne forboden \u00fe\u00e6tte \u00e6hta habban, gif ge \u00fea on riht strena\u00fe; for\u00feon Gode is swi\u00fee leof \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00de\u00e6m Drihtne sy lof, & wuldor, & sibb, on ecnesse in ealra worlda world, a buton ende.\nAmen.",
